# Runtime state. It belongs to the machine that ran the plugin, not to the repo:
# `restart-dsh.log` carries authenticated `?token=…` URLs and the local user's
# paths, and the shortcut records name a real desktop. Newer builds keep these
# under $DSH_HOME/storages/dsh-power-switch/, but they are listed here too so a
# checkout that ran an older build can never commit them.
node_modules/
restart-dsh.log
dsh-web*.log
restart-handshake-*.txt
shortcut-backup.txt
shortcut-result.txt

# Editor and OS noise.
*.swp
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
